# Curated AppImages for lsl-usb (bin/lsl-appimages.sh).
# Format: name<TAB>type<TAB>source<TAB>asset-substring
#   type=github: source = owner/repo; the latest release's first .appimage
#                asset whose name contains the substring is downloaded.
#   type=url:    source = direct URL (substring unused).
# All entries verified to resolve via the GitHub API (2026-08).
rustdesk	github	rustdesk/rustdesk	x86_64
keepassxc	github	keepassxreboot/keepassxc	x86_64
freecad	github	FreeCAD/FreeCAD	x86_64
standardnotes	github	standardnotes/app	x86_64
logseq	github	logseq/logseq	x86_64
heroic	github	Heroic-Games-Launcher/HeroicGamesLauncher	x86_64
protonup-qt	github	DavidoTek/ProtonUp-Qt	x86_64
openra	github	OpenRA/OpenRA	x86_64
onlyoffice	github	ONLYOFFICE/DesktopEditors	x86_64
joplin	github	laurent22/joplin	AppImage
audacity	github	audacity/audacity	x64
anytype	github	anyproto/anytype-ts	AppImage
pcsx2	github	PCSX2/pcsx2	x64
